WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:06.995
The spacefish pulled Bot's arm.

2
00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:10.066
"Are you okay?" Ringo called.

3
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:14.615
"I'm fine!" Bot said.

4
00:00:14.616 --> 00:00:21.100
The fish dragged the ship across the ocean.

5
00:00:21.101 --> 00:00:32.006
"I can't fly the ship," Ringo said.

6
00:00:32.007 --> 00:00:37.575
"That fish is too strong!"

7
00:00:37.576 --> 00:00:42.483
Ringo fired the ship's laser.

8
00:00:42.484 --> 00:00:47.937
But he couldn't hit the fish.

9
00:00:47.938 --> 00:00:51.688
"The ship is bouncing too much!" he said.

10
00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:54.178
Bot pulled in her arm.

11
00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:57.488
The spaceship moved closer to the fish.

12
00:00:57.489 --> 00:01:01.569
Ringo fired again. Splash!

13
00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:08.858
Water blocked the laser.

14
00:01:08.859 --> 00:01:16.383
"Grr!" Ringo cried. "What should I do?"

15
00:01:16.384 --> 00:01:18.913
He looked around the ship.

16
00:01:18.914 --> 00:01:24.990
He found a long antenna.

17
00:01:24.991 --> 00:01:28.896
Then he poked the fish with it!

18
00:01:28.897 --> 00:01:32.396
The spacefish wiggled.

19
00:01:32.397 --> 00:01:36.152
"This fish is ticklish!" Ringo cried.

20
00:01:36.153 --> 00:01:38.855
Ringo poked the fish again.

21
00:01:38.856 --> 00:01:43.478
The fish wiggled all over.

22
00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:47.530
It jerked its head.

23
00:01:47.531 --> 00:01:50.263
Its mouth opened.

24
00:01:50.264 --> 00:01:53.592
The spaceship flew through the air.

25
00:01:53.593 --> 00:01:56.635
"Ahh!" Ringo said.

26
00:01:56.636 --> 00:02:00.527
Bam! The ship slammed into something.

27
00:02:00.528 --> 00:02:13.944
Then it crashed onto ice and slid backward.

28
00:02:13.945 --> 00:02:18.440
"Ouch." Ringo rubbed his head.

29
00:02:18.441 --> 00:02:22.595
Then he saw a huge spaceship.

30
00:02:22.596 --> 00:02:29.248
"That's a delivery ship!" Ringo said.

31
00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:33.260
The driver smiled. "Space Patrol!

32
00:02:33.261 --> 00:02:35.892
I'm happy to see you.

33
00:02:35.893 --> 00:02:41.473
I've been stuck here for days!"

